{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f344d0043286d053","name":"Beastwarden Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-f344d0043286d053","title":"Beastwarden Talent Tree","revision":16183,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:27Z","sha256":"c56c3db9000cf53c1d4f91d899cf22ccb64a98603bd746900a73443960fb7f4c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16183","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Beastwarden%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f344d0043286d053","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have learned to use ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to touch the minds of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beasts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beasts"},", soothing them and convincing them to do your bidding.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Beastwarden Charm Beast"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check in place of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check when attempting to change the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attitude"}," of an undomesticated creature with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," score of 2 or less. Additionally, you do not take the normal -5 penalty on the check if the creature can't speak or understand your language. This Talent is identical to the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dathomiri Charm Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dathomiri_Charm_Beast"}]}," Talent, and both are considered to be the same Talent for the purposes of satisfying prerequisites.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Bonded Mount"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Beastwarden Charm Beast"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you encounter a domesticated ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," with a Friendly or Helpful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attitude"}," toward you, you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"}," to bond the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," to you as a mount. A ",{"tag":"b","children":["Bonded Mount"]}," shares an emphatic link with you, allowing you to sense its emotions as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ride"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ride","referenceId":"reference:439efdc566bb419f"}," a ",{"tag":"b","children":["Bonded Mount"]},", your mount uses your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," instead of its own. Additionally, if your mount has any special senses (such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scent"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darkvision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darkvision"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Low-Light Vision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Low-Light_Vision"},") that you do not possess, you gain the benefits of its special senses as long as you are riding that mount.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Entreat Beast"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Beastwarden Charm Beast"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can use ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to convince a small ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," to carry objects, deliver messages, or perform other minor tasks for you. If you are near a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," that is at least Indifferent to you (whether this be a pet you bring with you or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," encountered in the wild), you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check against the Beast's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},". If your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," equals or exceeds the Beast's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," performs one task for you from the following list:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Deliver an Object:"]}," The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," attempts, to the best of its ability, to deliver one object from your person to another target within 30 squares of you."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Retrieve an Object:"]}," The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," attempts, to the best of its ability, to retrieve one unattended object within 30 squares of it and its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," and bring it to you."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Manipulate a Small Object:"]}," The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," attempts, to the best of its ability, to press a button, pull a lever, or otherwise perform some minor activation of an unattended item within 30 squares."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Soothing Presence"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Beastwarden Charm Beast"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you encounter a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," with an Unfriendly ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attitude"}," toward you, you automatically shift its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attitude"}," to Indifferent (no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," required).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Wild Sense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Beastwarden Charm Beast"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," once per turn, you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check to touch the mind of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," with an Indifferent or better ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attitude"}," toward you, provided it is within 12 squares of you and in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". When you do so, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," makes an immediate active ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check, and you are considered to perceive everything the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," does, including noticing targets, as though you had made the check.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Additionally, until the end of your turn, you are considered to have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," to anything the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," has ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," to.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
